Droum
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 58 DEAL UDI
UDI 6 FACE_LAST
UDI 0 FACE_LAST
UDI 1 FACE_LAST
UDI 2 FACE_LAST
UDI 8 FACE_LAST
UDI 1 FACE_LAST

AWE 0 FACE_ALL
AWE 2 FACE_ALL
AWE 2 FACE_ALL
AWE 10 FACE_ALL
AWE 4 FACE_ALL
AWE 3 FACE_ALL
AWE 2 FACE_ALL
AWE 5 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE AWE AWE
SRC Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
MOVE_STACK UDI AWE
AND
    OR
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS, SPADES, CLUBS}
        SRCSTACK Suit match
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        SRCSTACK Suit match
MOVE_STACK AWE AWE
DEST Suit {CLUBS}
DRAW
PILE ANY UDI Empty
$win
PILE ALL AWE Empty
